OL,3,GNEWSAMother of Henry Nowak killer could
OL,4,Abe deported
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of murderer Vickrum Digwa
OL,7,Fcould be in line for deportation from
OL,8,Fthe UK, the Home Office has signalled.
OL,10,FKiran Kaur, 53, was jailed for three
OL,11,Fyears in July for removing the knife
OL,12,Fused by her son, Vickrum Digwa, to kill
OL,13,Fstudent Henry Nowak from the crime
OL,14,Fscene.
OL,16,FHowever Kaur, who spent several months
OL,17,Fon remand, could serve less than half
OL,18,Fof her sentence and be freed around the
OL,19,Fanniversary of Mr Nowak's death under
OL,20,Fthe Government's early release scheme,
OL,21,FITV News reported.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
