OL,3,GNEWSAMother of Henry Nowak killer could
OL,4,Abe deported
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office declined to comment on
OL,7,Findividual cases, but said: "We will
OL,8,Falways seek to deport foreign criminals
OL,9,Fat the first opportunity."
